      "source": "The filter bean type that must not be present.",
      "translation": "必须不存在的过滤器 Bean 类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "When placed on a <code>@Bean</code> method, the bean class defaults to the return type of\nthe factory method or the type of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> if the bean is a\n<a href=\"../../web/servlet/FilterRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>FilterRegistrationBean</code></a>:",
      "translation": "当放置在 <code>@Bean</code> 方法上时，bean 类的默认值为工厂方法的返回类型；如果该 bean 是 <a href=\"../../web/servlet/FilterRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>FilterRegistrationBean</code></a>，则默认为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> 的类型：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "In the sample above the condition will match if no bean of type <code>MyFilter</code> or\n<code>FilterRegistrationBean&lt;MyFilter&gt;</code> is already contained in the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在上面的示例中，如果 `BeanFactory` 中尚未包含类型为 <code>MyFilter</code> 或 <code>FilterRegistrationBean&lt;MyFilter&gt;</code> 的 Bean，则该条件将匹配。",
